  "remarks": "CJSC TECHNOSVYAZ specialises in manufacture of electrical and optical equipment. It supplies electronics to JSC IEMZ Kupol. It specifically provides it with semi-finished electronics and components used in the production of the Garpiya-A1 one-way attack UAV. These UAVs are used by the Russian Armed Forces during Russia’s war of aggression against Ukraine.",
